// sweep and called that an environment; a preset is meant to carry the lanes,
// the sweep, the darkness, the air and in time the bloom, together. They are
// in git until they do.
//
// The numbering is deliberately not tidied. These are the indices the profiles
// and the colour tables are written against, and renumbering them to close the
// gaps would silently repoint every saved config at a different preset.
